# 特殊句式
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语
# 来源: 2023田静句句真研
# 描述: 倒装句、强调句、虚拟语气等特殊句式详解

{{全部倒装概述}}{{整个谓语动词提到主语之前。常见场景：地点/方位副词(here, there, up, down, away, out)在句首+不及物动词+名词主语。例：Here comes the bus. / Away flew the bird. 主语为代词时不倒装：Here it comes.}}

{{部分倒装概述}}{{助动词/情态动词/系动词提到主语之前，谓语其余部分保留在主语后。相当于一般疑问句的语序。例：Never have I seen such a thing. / Only then did I realize my mistake.}}

{{否定词置于句首的倒装}}{{never, rarely, seldom, hardly, scarcely, barely, little, no sooner...than, hardly...when, not until, by no means, in no way, under no circumstances等置于句首时，句子部分倒装。例：Not until midnight did he finish his work.}}

{{only+状语置于句首的倒装}}{{Only in this way can we solve the problem. / Only when he told me did I realize the truth. only修饰主语时不倒装：Only he can solve this problem.}}

{{so/neither/nor引起的倒装}}{{表"也…"或"也不…"。He is a student. — So am I. / He doesn't like coffee. — Neither/Nor do I. 但So he is.表"确实如此"（不倒装）。}}

{{as引导的让步倒装}}{{形容词/副词/名词/动词+as+主语+谓语。例：Young as he is, he is very capable. / Try as he might, he failed. / Child as he is, he knows a lot.(名词前不加冠词)。}}

{{强调句型It is/was...that/who...}}{{强调除谓语外的任何成分。It was yesterday that I met him.(强调时间) / It was he who/that broke the window.(强调人) 判断方法：去掉It is/was和that/who，剩余部分能组成完整句子。}}

{{do/does/did强调谓语}}{{在动词原形前加do/does/did表示强调。例：I do believe you. / She does look beautiful. / He did come yesterday. 只用于一般现在时和一般过去时的肯定句。}}

{{what引导的强调句型}}{{What引导的主语从句表强调。What I need is a good rest. / What he said is true. what = the thing(s) that，强调"…的东西/事情"。}}

{{虚拟语气-与现在事实相反}}{{if从句用一般过去时(be动词用were)，主句用would/could/might/should + 动词原形。例：If I were you, I would accept the offer. / If he had more money, he would buy a house.}}

{{虚拟语气-与过去事实相反}}{{if从句用had done，主句用would/could/might/should + have done。例：If I had studied harder, I would have passed the exam. / If it hadn't rained, we would have gone out.}}

{{虚拟语气-与将来事实相反}}{{if从句用should do / were to do / 一般过去时，主句用would/could/might/should + 动词原形。例：If it should rain tomorrow, we would cancel the trip.}}

{{虚拟语气的省略与倒装}}{{省略if，将had/should/were提前。Had I known (= If I had known), I would have helped. / Should it rain (= If it should rain), we would cancel. / Were I you (= If I were you), I would go.}}

{{wish后的虚拟语气}}{{wish + 过去时(现在)，wish + had done(过去)，wish + would/could do(将来)。例：I wish I were taller. / I wish I had studied harder. / I wish he would come tomorrow.}}

{{suggest/demand等动词后的虚拟}}{{suggest, demand, insist, recommend, require, propose, order等后的宾语从句用(should) + 动词原形。例：I suggest that he (should) study harder. 名词形式的同位语从句和表语从句也用此规则。}}

{{It is + 形容词 + that虚拟}}{{It is important/necessary/essential/vital/urgent that... (should) + 动词原形。例：It is necessary that he (should) be present at the meeting.}}

{{would rather后的虚拟}}{{would rather + 过去时(现在/将来)，would rather + had done(过去)。例：I would rather you stayed here. / I would rather you had not told him.}}

{{if only引导的虚拟}}{{表"要是…就好了"。If only I were rich.(现在) / If only I had studied harder.(过去) / If only he would come!(将来) 语气比wish更强烈。}}

{{混合虚拟条件句}}{{条件从句和主句所指时间不一致。例：If I had taken your advice (过去), I would be a rich man now (现在). 需根据时间状语判断虚拟类型。}}

{{含蓄虚拟条件}}{{without, but for, otherwise, or等暗含虚拟条件。Without your help (= If it hadn't been for your help), I would have failed. / But for the rain, we would have gone out. / I was busy, otherwise I would have helped you.}}
